# Model staging directory.
#
# Everything dropped in here is ignored by default: real mesh assets are large
# and get versioned through your own workflow (see README.md), not through this
# repo. Only this .gitignore and README.md stay tracked, which is what keeps the
# otherwise-empty directory present in git.
#
# To start versioning a specific model anyway:
#   git add -f src/assets/models/<that-one-file>.glb
# or turn on Git LFS and relax the rules below - see the repo-root .gitattributes
# for the exact steps.
*
!README.md
!.gitignore
